# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizer builds (docs/port/SANITIZE.md 4): check:function, each
# with its reason. A finding not listed fails its test (halt_on_error=1 in ctest's environment).

# The game C's design: Tracker.idx is declared with 17 slots and the records carry 20, which the N64 code fills
# (route_cross/group.c's own comment). A member array used past its end, as -Warray-bounds sees 260 times; the
# writes stay inside D_80151CE8 at its N64 layout.
bounds:^audio_mixer_main$

# A blank cartridge only (--no-rom, app_firstrun): with every file empty no heap block fits, and the N64 code reads
# the null block's size too.
null:^audio_helper$

# The synthetic cartridge's data (docs/port/SYNTH.md 4): its camera and particle positions are NaN, and the view and
# particle code converts them to integers. None of these on the retail paths (SANITIZE.md 3).
float-cast-overflow:^func_8009F058$
float-cast-overflow:^func_8009E8B4$
float-cast-overflow:^func_8009D45C$
float-cast-overflow:^func_8009D99C$
float-cast-overflow:^func_800A557C$
float-cast-overflow:^particle_system$
float-cast-overflow:^input_deadzone_apply$
float-cast-overflow:^display_update$

